        <item>
            <title>5.75</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 09:49:44 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>408</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.75</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.75</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Small reference videos are upscaled instead of rejected.</b> Clips below Seedance's minimum of 407,696 pixels, such as 848×480, are scaled to 720p size automatically when you attach them.</li>
<li><b>Seedance 2.5 combined length is 30 seconds.</b> Up to ten reference videos may total 30 seconds, matching the provider documentation. Single clips stay at 30 seconds, Seedance 2.0 keeps 15.</li>
<li><b>Pixel limits follow the provider documentation.</b> The minimum is now 407,696 pixels instead of 409,600, so Seedance's own 480p output is always accepted.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
